give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Assigned Mutant at Birth\"", "italic": true, "color": "aqua"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Clockmaker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many steps from the Demon to its nearest Minion."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Grandmother", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing a good player & their character. If the Demon kills them, you die too."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pixie", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 in-play Townsfolk. If you were mad that you were this character, you gain their ability when they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Undertaker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn which character died by execution today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Innkeeper", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose 2 players: they can't die tonight, but 1 is drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Nightwatchman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a player: they learn you are the Nightwatchman."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Philosopher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a good character: gain that ability. If this character is in play, they are drunk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Huntsman", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a living player: the Damsel, if chosen, becomes a not-in-play Townsfolk. [+the Damsel]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac (Night Version)", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each night*, guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are (even if dead, drunk, or poisoned)."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Magician", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe Demon thinks you are a Minion. Minions think you are a Demon."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Chambermaid", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 alive players (not yourself): you learn how many woke tonight due to their ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Farmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die at night, an alive good player becomes a Farmer."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lunatic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Saint", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you die by execution, your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \u201cmad\u201d about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cerenovus", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player & a good character: they are \u201cmad\u201d they are this character tomorrow, or might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Marionette", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou think you are a good character, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are. [You neighbor the Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Godfather", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing which Outsiders are in play. If 1 died today, choose a player tonight: they die. [-1 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Harpy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: tomorrow, the 1st player is mad that the 2nd is evil, or one or both might die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Kazali", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. [You choose which players are which Minions. -? to +? Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Apprentice", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOn your 1st night, you gain a Townsfolk ability (if good), or a Minion ability (if evil)."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cacklejack", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach day, choose a player: a different player changes character tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Harlot", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night*, choose a living player: if they agree, you learn their character, but you both might die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bishop", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnly the Storyteller can nominate. At least 1 opposing player must be nominated each day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Duchess", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nEach day, 3 players may choose to visit you. At night*, each visitor learns how many visitors are evil, but 1 gets false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nThis script has homebrew characters or rules."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Assigned Mutant at Birth Script", "italic": false, "color": "aqua", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Assigned Mutant at Birth\"", "italic": false, "color": "aqua"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]